rror::FillZero)?;\n145\t\n146\t    // Phase 1: Build descriptor array on host (CPU-only, no CUDA API calls)\n147\t    let mut descs: Vec<StackColDesc> = Vec::with_capacity(layout.sorted_cols.len());\n148\t    for (mat_idx, j, s) in &layout.sorted_cols {\n149\t        let start = s.col_idx * padded_height + s.row_idx;\n150\t        let trace = traces[*mat_idx];\n151\t        let s_len = s.len(l_skip);\n152\t        debug_assert_eq!(trace.height(), 1 << s.log_height());\n153\t        let (src, height, stride) = if s.log_height() >= l_skip {\n154\t            debug_assert_eq!(trace.height(), s_len);\n155\t            let src = unsafe { trace.buffer().as_ptr().add(*j * s_len) };\n156\t            (src, s_len as u32, 1u32)\n157\t        } else {\n158\t            let stride = s.stride(l_skip);\n159\t            debug_assert_eq!(stride * trace.height(), s_len);\n160\t            let src = unsafe { trace.buffer().as_ptr().add(*j * trace.height()) };\n161\t            (src, trace.height() as u32, stride as u32)\n162\t        };\n163\t        let dst = unsafe { buffer.as_mut_ptr().add(start) };\n164\t        descs.push(StackColDesc { src, dst, height, stride });\n165\t    }\n166\t\n167\t    // Phase 2: Upload descriptors to GPU and launch single scatter kernel\n168\t    if !descs.is_empty() {\n169\t        let d_descs = descs.to_device().map_err(StackTracesError::DescriptorUpload)?;\n170\t        unsafe { stack_columns(&d_descs).map_err(StackTracesError::StackColumns)? };\n171\t    }\n172\t    Ok(())\n173\t}\n174\t\n175\t/// Computes the Reed-Solomon codeword of each column vector of `eval_matrix` where the rate is\n176\t/// `2^{-log_blowup}`. The column vectors are treated as evaluations of a prismalinear extension on\n177\t/// a hyperprism.\n178\t///\n179\t/// Uses `stacked_matrix` if available, or else stacks `traces` directly into final codeword matrix\n180\t/// buffer.\n181\t#[instrument(skip_all)]\n182\tpub fn rs_code_matrix(\n183\t    log_blowup: usize,\n184\t    layo