n   ```\n\n2. **Lines 272-295**: For each x_int value:\n   - Compute per-coset selectors (is_first[c], is_last[c])\n   - Call `acc_interactions<NUM_COSETS>()` (line 284) which evaluates all cosets lockstep\n   - Weight results by eq_cube[x_int]\n\n3. **Intermediates storage** (zerocheck_round0.cu Lines 113-123):\n   - If `header.buffer_result && buffer_size > 0`:\n   ```cuda\n   // Layout: [buffer_size][NUM_COSETS] per thread\n   eval_ctx.inter_buffer[z_index * buffer_stride + c] = x_vals[c];\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### **5. INTERMEDIATES BUFFER SIZE COMPUTATION**\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/eval_config.cuh`\n\n#### **Formula for Zerocheck Intermediates (Lines 84-106)**\n```cpp\ninline uint32_t intermediates_buffer_size(\n    uint32_t buffer_size,      // Number of intermediate nodes in DAG\n    uint32_t skip_domain,\n    uint32_t num_x,\n    uint32_t num_cosets,\n    size_t max_temp_bytes,\n    uint32_t buffer_threshold,\n    uint32_t threads_per_block\n) {\n    if (buffer_size <= buffer_threshold) {\n        return 0;  // Uses only shared/local memory\n    }\n    auto [grid, block] = eval_constraints_launch_params(...);\n    // Layout: [buffer_size][num_threads][num_cosets]\n    return grid.x * block.x * buffer_size * num_cosets;  // Line 106\n}\n```\n\n**Key factors per AIR:**\n- `buffer_size`: Count of intermediate nodes in constraint DAG (u32 field)\n- `num_x`: 2^n_lift (trace height in lifted domain)\n- `num_cosets`: constraint_degree - 1 (zerocheck), constraint_degree (logup)\n- `skip_domain`: 2^l_skip (evaluates constraint_degree many polynomial shifts)\n\n**Pre-computed at keygen:**\n- `zerocheck_round0.inner.buffer_size` stored in `SymbolicRulesGpu::buffer_size` (line 64, round0.rs)\n- `logup_round0_buffer_size` stored in `GpuDeviceStarkProvingKeyOtherData` (pkey.rs, line 35)\n\n#### **Formula for Zerocheck Temp Sums (Lines 61-80)**\n```cpp\ninline uint32_t temp_sums_buffer_size(\n    uint32_t buffer_size,